      "content": "TL 10 SW                    ST STEPHEN           NOKE LANE                                                  (east side) 12/325                                           Little Daneswick II House.  Formerly farmhouse.  Mid-late C17.  Exposed timber frame with painted brick.  Circa 1930 painted brick left extension and 1983 brick and timber frame rear left extension.  Plain tile roof with rebuilt central ridge   stack.   2 storeys.   4 leaded casements.  Original house is 3 bays.  Interior with roll-moulded beams to centre bay.   Inglenook between centre and left bay, formerly with staircase attached.  Clasped purlin roof with wide tie and roof braces. Listing NGR: TL1218804306"
    }
